    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「……おっと、と？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ごめん、余所見しながら歩いてたら転びそうになっちゃった」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「支えてくれて、ありがと。ごめんね、わたし重いでしょ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「まぁ君も、ちょっと逞しくなったからだいじょうぶかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あはは、ふたりで歩いてこんなふうに密着しちゃってさ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「誰かに見られたら誤解されちゃうかもね〜、な〜んちゃって！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「…………」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（あぁもう……、自分のテンションがおかしいのがわかる！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "（何でこんなに緊張するんだろ〜、子供のころと同じようにすればいいだけなのになあ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「でも、さ。何か久しぶりだよね、ふたりっきりなのは」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「そりゃあ、たまに登下校とかでいっしょになったけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「歩いてるうちに、必ず誰かに会っちゃって『みんないっしょ』になっちゃうもんね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「君が転校してきてから、毎日けっこう大騒ぎで……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ちゃんと、ふたりで話す機会がなかったよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「どう？　学校にはもう慣れた？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「な〜んてね、見てればわかるよ。すっかり、君咲学院の一員になってるよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしも、一安心だよ。最初のうちはさ、お節介いっぱい焼いちゃおうと思ってたんだけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「その必要がないぐらい、いつの間にかみんなと打ち解けてたよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「正直、ちょっと寂しいぐらいだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしがお世話してあげなくちゃ、なんて腕まくりする必要なかったよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ほんとに君は逞しく、おおきくなったんだよね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「って、君、君、って呼ぶの他人行儀かな？　でも、みんな『転校生くん』って呼ぶんだもん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしも、幼なじみとはいえ離れてた時期が長かったしさ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「君と、どういう距離感で付きあっていいかわかんないんだよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「何か、てきとうな渾名があればいいんだけどね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「本名で呼ぶより馴れ馴れしくなくて、『転校生くん』より親しげな感じの〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「たとえば『ダーリン』とか……いや『ダーリン』はだめか……う〜む」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-yukata",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-yukata_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あっ、射的があるよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「閃いたっ、あれやろうよ。それでさ、射的で当てたものを君の渾名にするから。」"
